OL,4,G2200FGeoff Norcott's Working Men's Club
OL,5,     GGeoff examines modern
OL,6,     Gmasculinity, with the help of his
OL,7,     Gaudience in Leeds. This week he
OL,8,     Gasks, why aren't men honest about
OL,9,     Gtheir partner's faults?
OL,10,G2230FAny Bloke
OL,11,     GHow will Phil overcome his
OL,12,     Gjealousy while partner Sarah is
OL,13,     Gin Paris? Stars Jim Sweeney and
OL,14,     GCaroline Quentin. From 1993.
OL,15,G2255FThe Comedy Club Interview
OL,16,     GFrom 10pm until midnight, seven
OL,17,     Gdays a week, the Comedy Club has
OL,18,     Gtwo hours of comedy. Plus Jake
OL,19,     GYapp chats again to the comedian
OL,20,     GPhil Ellis.
